Very small\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/784909da-c813-4da7-84e2-466477438373\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate RichTextLabel with some text->turn resize_font_to_fit on->change visible_ratio or visible_characters\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nCan be reproduced on new project.\nGodot 4.8 dev6\n[RichLabelAutoResizeBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32293466/RichLabelAutoResizeBug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123551/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123551/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}